{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103840","id":2380436212,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6N4pL0","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103840","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103840.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103840.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103840","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103840/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/103840/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103840/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/9f9cbda7acf62be649d61edc31a1aed47a2acdf6","number":103840,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix CurveEdit not notifying about all changes","user":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Closes #103831\r\n\r\nUnlike `Curve::set_point_value()`, `Curve::set_point_offset()` doesn't mark curve as dirty which causes problems with `CurveEdit::set_point_position()` that calls them out of order and causes `CurveTexture` resource to not use the latest data of its `Curve`\r\n\r\nThis could be solved by adding `mark_dirty()` to `Curve::set_point_offset` but that would double the amount of calls to heavy `CurveTexture::_update`. So instead we're reversing the order of calls in `CurveEdit::set_point_position`. I made sure `set_point_value` is using the correct index (it's known in advance because drag has already happened)","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2025-03-09T01:09:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-10T09:57:10Z","closed_at":"2025-03-09T15:18:36Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"1146973df3e96665bc63c1588a581774481b2b4a","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"passivestar:fix-curve-update","ref":"fix-curve-update","repo":{"id":743252153,"node_id":"R_kgDOLE0guQ","name":"godot","full_name":"passivestar/godot","owner":{"login":"passivestar","id":60579014,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYwNTc5MDE0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/60579014?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar","html_url":"https://github.com/passivestar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/passivestar/o